---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 30, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — The HR Stack Guide"
  description="How Stack Guide Media collects, uses, and protects information when you visit The HR Stack Guide."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/" class="transition hover:text-indigo-600">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-300">&gt;</li>
          <li class="font-medium text-indigo-600" aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <article class="space-y-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
      <section>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          This Privacy Policy explains how Stack Guide Media ("Stack Guide Media," "we," "us," or "our")
          collects, uses, and shares information when you visit The HR Stack Guide (the "Site"). By using the
          Site, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          We do not require you to create an account or submit personal information to browse the Site. We do
          collect limited information automatically, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>
            <strong>Usage analytics</strong> — we use Vercel Web Analytics to understand aggregate traffic
            patterns, such as which pages are viewed and which outbound links are clicked. This data is
            privacy-friendly and does not use tracking cookies to build a personal profile of you.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Device and log information</strong> — standard web server logs (such as IP address,
            browser type, and referring page) may be collected by our hosting provider for security and
            performance purposes.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">How we use information</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          We use the information described above to operate and improve the Site, understand which
          comparisons and vendors are most useful to our readers, diagnose technical issues, and measure the
          performance of outbound links to vendor websites, including affiliate links described in our
          <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Third-party links and vendors</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          The Site contains links to third-party vendor websites, some of which are affiliate links. We do not
          control and are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third-party sites. We encourage
          you to review the privacy policy of any vendor site you visit, including any site you reach by
          clicking a link on the Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          The Site may use minimal, functional cookies required for the Site to operate correctly. Our
          analytics provider is designed to avoid persistent cross-site tracking cookies. If this changes, we
          will update this policy accordingly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Depending on where you live, you may have rights under applicable data protection laws (such as the
          GDPR or CCPA) to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information we hold about
          you. Because we collect very limited personal information, most requests can be handled quickly by
          contacting us using the details below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          The Site is intended for a business audience and is not directed at children under 16. We do not
          knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for legal
          reasons. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when this policy was last revised.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:dave@thehrstackguide.com" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">dave@thehrstackguide.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
